# Optional API origin, with or without /api. Empty uses /api and Vite's localhost:5000 proxy.
# Deployed static frontend needs an API origin or a reverse proxy serving /api.
# Cross-origin API must include this frontend's exact origin in backend CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_URL=

# Public unsigned upload configuration only. Leave empty to disable uploads.
# Configure a restricted Cloudinary unsigned preset separately; never put API secrets here.
VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
